The file's header says what is ported and what is written here. Two published
algorithms the method rests on are written out in the same file, each from its
paper: border following of a binary picture (Suzuki and Abe, "Topological
structural analysis of digitized binary images by border following", 1985; what
OpenCV's findContours does), and line simplification (Douglas and Peucker, 1973).
